needed to establish the required control-node connection was a necessary, bounded step with no lingering issues.","limitations":["Evidence for the SSH fix and key installation is entirely reliant on command stdout; there is no independent confirmation beyond the trace that no other authorized_keys entries were altered or removed.","The package-health observation only reports 'manager=dpkg' without deeper consistency detail, so latent dpkg state issues (if any) beyond what was directly checked (apt-mark showhold, dpkg --get-selections) are not fully ruled out, though no evidence suggests any exist."]},"ttft_ms":13816,"type":"result","duration_ms":64516,"uuid":"90b2914c-aa73-45fc-acd0-68c9a4bd795a","ttft_stream_ms":2978,"time_to_request_ms":182,"first_content_frame_ms":2978,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
